 "description": "----- Exclusive -----\nContact Xiao Yang (小杨) @ 8O1O1188 for an exclusive viewing.\n● Just MOP! First Owner Selling – Fresh from Oven!\n●  Super Convenient location!\n●  Very High Level\n●  Original 3 intact bedrooms (1 Master room + 2 Common rooms)\n●  Quiet and Superb View! Can view Marina Bay Sands clearly!\n●  North – South facing!\n●  Bright and Windy!\n●  Nicely Renovated!\n●  Very spacious & Squarish.\n●  NEAR Telok Blangah MRT & Bus stops\nBus stop just downstairs\n- Bus 124 (Direct bus to Harbourfront MRT Station/Vivocity/Chinatown/Orchard)\n- Bus 120 (to Redhill/Tiong Bahru)\n- Bus 273 (to Bukit Merah Central)\n5 min walk to Telok Blangah MRT Station\n●  Walking distance to nearby amenities, markets and food centres\n- Telok Blangah Market/Food Centre (3 min walk)\n- NTUC Fairprice Supermarket (3 min walk)\n- Alexandra Retail Mall (ARC) (8 min walk)\n- Mapletree Business City (10 min walk)\n●  Primary Schools within 1 km – Blangah Rise Primary\n●  Primary Schools within 2 km – Radin Mas Primary, Gan Eng Seng Primary\n------------------------------\nContact Xiao Yang (小杨) @ 8O1O1188 for an exclusive viewing.",
